    "text": "kecofm.com\nwebsite\nCanute\nPrecautionary Lockdown at Canute Schools Following High-Speed Chase\n11 hours ago\nCanute, OK – Canute Public Schools went into a precautionary lockdown Wednesday morning as law enforcement pursued a stolen vehicle in the area. The lockdown was implemented just before 8:30 a.m. after officials were alerted to the high-speed chase in Washita County. School leaders emphasized that students were never in any danger.",
